{'symbol': 'CTSH', 'date': '2022-07-07 03:00:00', 'title': 'ZURICH INSURANCE GERMANY SELECTS COGNIZANT AS STRATEGIC IT PARTNER TO TRANSFORM ITS GENERAL INSURANCE APPLICATION LANDSCAPE', 'text': "MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT WILL TRANSFORM THE INSURER'S APPLICATIONS TO ENHANCE THE DIGITAL EXPERIENCE OF ITS CUSTOMERS AND PARTNERS IN GERMANY TEANECK, N.J. , JULY 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COGNIZANT\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS EXTENDED ITS RELATIONSHIP WITH ZURICH BETEILIGUNGS-AG, THE GERMAN SUBSIDIARY OF GLOBAL INSURANCE LEADER ZURICH INSURANCE GROUP (ZURICH), TO HELP ZURICH GERMANY DELIVER MORE DIGITAL SERVICES OFFERINGS TO ITS CLIENTS AND PARTNERS."}